      "text": "Full-day group excursion to Machu Picchu, the “lost city of the Incas”, with an English-speaking guide. Built on a mountaintop of huge stone blocks fitted without mortar and surrounded by dense jungle, the citadel was never found by the Spanish conquerors and was brought to international attention in 1911 by the American explorer Hiram Bingham. Dinner, return to Cusco by train and transfer to the hotel.",
